    "text": "1 days ago ABBOTSFORD – The Spencer volleyball team saw its season come to an end with a 3-1 loss to Abbotsford in a WIAA Division 4 regional quarterfinal Tuesday at Abbotsford High School. The No. 7 seed Falcons won 25-20, 25-23, 24-26, 25-12, to move on to a regional semifinal Thursday... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
